# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VENDORED UPSTREAM CLONES AND DOWNLOADED TOOLCHAINS
# These are other people's repos kept inside a project for reference, or SDKs
# that can be re-downloaded. Ignoring them is what keeps WinCompat2 (23 GB)
# and IOS (9 GB) to a sane push size. The project's OWN source is unaffected.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
